00:00:08.170 --> 00:00:10.060
I see people are still coming.

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.200
I see empty spaces.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:13.600
Make yourself comfortable.

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.130
While you settle
