00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:20.200
Raise your hand.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:21.850
OK, quite a few.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:24.630
And among the others
if I say things like,

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:28.060
let's say, convolutional
layer or cross entropy loss,

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:31.420
if it rings a bell, if you
know what I'm talking about,

00:00:31.420 --> 00:00:33.580
raise your hand.

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.650
OK, a few as well.

00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:39.570
All the others, you will
